# ritz1/src/emitter_call_lower.ritz - the call path's parts that never recurse into emit_expr: argument and receiver place facts, conversions, sizeof, enum payload shapes, builtin method pieces, the intrinsic table
#
# Split out by AGAST #1818: these never reach emit_expr / emit_stmt, so they
# sit below the emission modules, which import them.

